5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"We need a fair way to allocate the spaces, but we should be careful not to create unnecessary tension among the residents. Let's look into the facts before deciding on a system.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Misaki-san. It is so important that we all remain friends and neighbors. Let's find a way that makes everyone feel cared for and keeps the peace in our lovely building.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Peace is lovely, but let's be real—fairness usually comes down to the numbers. I want to know exactly how this affects our pockets and the building's budget. Let's get some hard data first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,"I agree that we need a balanced approach. However, we must also consider who will actually manage the system once it's decided. We shouldn't create a burden that is impossible to maintain long-term.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I totally agree! But I've heard some people grumbling that the same people always get the best spots. I want to know if that's actually true or just a misunderstanding! Let's find out the truth!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"To understand the current atmosphere and avoid future conflict, I'll look into the last year's complaint log entries and the five years of association minutes. I want to see how previous disputes were handled.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think it would be helpful to see how people are actually using the space. I will look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm going for the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections. If we're talking about fairness, we need to see where the money is actually going.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the sticker register and the daily riders. I want to understand the actual administrative effort required to manage the spaces.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders to see who's actually using the spots! Also, I want to see the five years of association minutes to see if the same people always win!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"It seems we have a good spread of information. By looking at the history and the complaints, I hope to find a way to implement a rule that doesn't damage our community spirit.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful that we are all looking at this from different angles. I hope that by understanding the daily struggles of our neighbors, we can find a solution that brings a smile to everyone's face.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"Let's just hope the ""daily struggles"" aren't just people being lazy. I'm expecting some interesting surprises in those financial files. Let's see if the money actually adds up to something useful for us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I believe we have covered the necessary bases. My main concern remains the sustainability of the workload. I look forward to seeing if the records reveal a manageable process or a recipe for burnout.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to see what we find! If we can prove whether there's actually a pattern of favoritism, we can finally make a system that's fair for everyone. Let's do this!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I think we are all set. Let's proceed with our research and meet again to share what we've discovered. I hope we can find a solution that keeps our daily interactions pleasant.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I look forward to it. Let us all be kind to one another as we search for the truth. I will be praying that we find a gentle solution that makes everyone's morning a little brighter.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready. Let's stop the dreaming and start the digging. I'll see you all in the next round—I can't wait to see if the numbers back up the drama!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. Let us review the findings carefully when we return. I hope the data provides a clear picture of the effort involved so we can make a practical decision.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'll be digging through those records with everything I've got! See you all soon—I can't wait to see if my hunch about the favoritism is right! Let's make this fair!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
